data: {"id": "c98dcb54f2ff4c7c-thinking-parallel_evidence-806", "run_id": "c98dcb54f2ff4c7c", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实与因果链\n\n**Pod 身份与状态**\n- `aiops-case-v05/workload` (UID `b9e687f5-...`) 调度到 `node2`，自 2026-09-11T10:16:10Z 创建后一直卡在 **Pending / ContainerCreating**，已持续约 78 分钟，重启次数为 0。\n\n**根因证据（来自 kubectl describe Events）**\n- `FailedMount` (x45 over 78m): `MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap references non-existent config key: unavailable-key`\n- `FailedMount` (x31 over 76m): `Unable to attach or mount volumes: unmounted volumes=[input], unattached volumes=[input]: timed out waiting for the", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789126519205, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "c98dcb54f2ff4c7c-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "c98dcb54f2ff4c7c", "seq": 807, "ts_ms": 1789126530075, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 40.705, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-v05", "name": "workload"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/c98dcb54f2ff4c7c-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "564b75daa43b6802eae48a12c5fd1cddfbd0cb3c49b1107e81d977f7b0a0e453", "bytes": 2420}, "snapshot_sha256": "38c03c09b5d4b7b78b7d5290550cc060d77fbe447df3787fbd2b1b4a3434b2c2"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: node_start
data: {"id": "c98dcb54f2ff4c7c-node_start-conclusion", "run_id": "c98dcb54f2ff4c7c", "seq": 808, "ts_ms": 1789126530076, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "c98dcb54f2ff4c7c-node_complete-conclusion", "run_id": "c98dcb54f2ff4c7c", "seq": 809, "ts_ms": 1789126539638, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结", "duration_seconds": 9.563, "state_snapshot": {"conclusion_length": 1801, "has_errors": false, "has_warnings": false, "conclusion": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v05/workload` | ContainerCreating | Pod 'workload' in namespace 'aiops-case-v05' is stuck in 'ContainerCreating' / 'Pending' status for over 78 minutes. |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Warning FailedMount ... MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap references non-existent config key: unavailable-key` (fact-86c016f70b3e) | 直接证明挂载卷失败的具体原因：ConfigMap 引用了不存在的键 |\n| 2 | K8s State | kubernetes | Pod phase: `Pending`, container app status: `ContainerCreating` (fact-46054095b465, fact-a93fca118b11) | 确认 Pod 因挂载问题被阻断在启动前阶段，未进入运行态 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Warning FailedMount ... Unable to attach or mount volumes: unmounted volumes=[input]` (fact-be159fd46224) | 辅助证明 kubelet 在长达 76 分钟内持续尝试挂载卷 `input` 均告失败 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` (container=app, reason=ContainerCreating) = 1 (fact-75d05dfe3691) | 从监控指标维度印证容器当前处于等待启动状态 |\n\n**证据印证说明：**\n1. K8s Event 直接指出了失败机制（`configmap references non-existent config key: unavailable-key`），这与 Pod 状态（`Pending` / `ContainerCreating`）及 Metrics 中的等待原因完全一致。\n2. 容器未进入运行状态，因此 Logging 和 Tracing 数据不适用（fact-86c016f70b3e 描述的事件也解释了无日志生成的原因）。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nConfigMap 'workload-input' 缺失 Pod 卷定义中引用的 'unavailable-key' → kubelet 挂载卷 'input' 失败并持续重试 → Pod 'workload' 卡在 'Pending' 阶段，容器处于 'ContainerCreating' 状态 → 用户可见 Pod 无法就绪，无任何应用日志或流量\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因**：Pod `aiops-case-v05/workload` 的 Volume 挂载失败，导致容器无法启动。\n*   **机制**：Pod 配置中卷 `input` 试图引用 ConfigMap `workload-input` 的键 `unavailable-key`，但该键在 ConfigMap 中不存在（依据证据 #1, fact-86c016f70b3e）。\n*   **结果**：kubelet 在长达 78 分钟内持续因该挂载错误而阻塞（依据证据 #1, #3），导致容器 `app` 始终无法启动（依据证据 #2, #4）。", "conclusion_formatted": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v05/workload` | ContainerCreating | Pod 'workload' in namespace 'aiops-case-v05' is stuck in 'ContainerCreating' / 'Pending' status for over 78 minutes. |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Warning FailedMount ... MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap references non-existent config key: unavailable-key` (fact-86c016f70b3e) | 直接证明挂载卷失败的具体原因：ConfigMap 引用了不存在的键 |\n| 2 | K8s State | kubernetes | Pod phase: `Pending`, container app status: `ContainerCreating` (fact-46054095b465, fact-a93fca118b11) | 确认 Pod 因挂载问题被阻断在启动前阶段，未进入运行态 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Warning FailedMount ... Unable to attach or mount volumes: unmounted volumes=[input]` (fact-be159fd46224) | 辅助证明 kubelet 在长达 76 分钟内持续尝试挂载卷 `input` 均告失败 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` (container=app, reason=ContainerCreating) = 1 (fact-75d05dfe3691) | 从监控指标维度印证容器当前处于等待启动状态 |\n\n**证据印证说明：**\n1. K8s Event 直接指出了失败机制（`configmap references non-existent config key: unavailable-key`），这与 Pod 状态（`Pending` / `ContainerCreating`）及 Metrics 中的等待原因完全一致。\n2. 容器未进入运行状态，因此 Logging 和 Tracing 数据不适用（fact-86c016f70b3e 描述的事件也解释了无日志生成的原因）。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nConfigMap 'workload-input' 缺失 Pod 卷定义中引用的 'unavailable-key' → kubelet 挂载卷 'input' 失败并持续重试 → Pod 'workload' 卡在 'Pending' 阶段，容器处于 'ContainerCreating' 状态 → 用户可见 Pod 无法就绪，无任何应用日志或流量\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因**：Pod `aiops-case-v05/workload` 的 Volume 挂载失败，导致容器无法启动。\n*   **机制**：Pod 配置中卷 `input` 试图引用 ConfigMap `workload-input` 的键 `unavailable-key`，但该键在 ConfigMap 中不存在（依据证据 #1, fact-86c016f70b3e）。\n*   **结果**：kubelet 在长达 78 分钟内持续因该挂载错误而阻塞（依据证据 #1, #3），导致容器 `app` 始终无法启动（依据证据 #2, #4）。"}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: final
data: {"id": "c98dcb54f2ff4c7c-final", "run_id": "c98dcb54f2ff4c7c", "seq": 811, "ts_ms": 1789126539648, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v05/workload` | ContainerCreating | Pod 'workload' in namespace 'aiops-case-v05' is stuck in 'ContainerCreating' / 'Pending' status for over 78 minutes. |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Warning FailedMount ... MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap references non-existent config key: unavailable-key` (fact-86c016f70b3e) | 直接证明挂载卷失败的具体原因：ConfigMap 引用了不存在的键 |\n| 2 | K8s State | kubernetes | Pod phase: `Pending`, container app status: `ContainerCreating` (fact-46054095b465, fact-a93fca118b11) | 确认 Pod 因挂载问题被阻断在启动前阶段，未进入运行态 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Warning FailedMount ... Unable to attach or mount volumes: unmounted volumes=[input]` (fact-be159fd46224) | 辅助证明 kubelet 在长达 76 分钟内持续尝试挂载卷 `input` 均告失败 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` (container=app, reason=ContainerCreating) = 1 (fact-75d05dfe3691) | 从监控指标维度印证容器当前处于等待启动状态 |\n\n**证据印证说明：**\n1. K8s Event 直接指出了失败机制（`configmap references non-existent config key: unavailable-key`），这与 Pod 状态（`Pending` / `ContainerCreating`）及 Metrics 中的等待原因完全一致。\n2. 容器未进入运行状态，因此 Logging 和 Tracing 数据不适用（fact-86c016f70b3e 描述的事件也解释了无日志生成的原因）。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nConfigMap 'workload-input' 缺失 Pod 卷定义中引用的 'unavailable-key' → kubelet 挂载卷 'input' 失败并持续重试 → Pod 'workload' 卡在 'Pending' 阶段，容器处于 'ContainerCreating' 状态 → 用户可见 Pod 无法就绪，无任何应用日志或流量\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因**：Pod `aiops-case-v05/workload` 的 Volume 挂载失败，导致容器无法启动。\n*   **机制**：Pod 配置中卷 `input` 试图引用 ConfigMap `workload-input` 的键 `unavailable-key`，但该键在 ConfigMap 中不存在（依据证据 #1, fact-86c016f70b3e）。\n*   **结果**：kubelet 在长达 78 分钟内持续因该挂载错误而阻塞（依据证据 #1, #3），导致容器 `app` 始终无法启动（依据证据 #2, #4）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.1m\n├─ 问题定位: 15.1s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 40.7s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v05/workload: 40.7s (Evidence 29.9s, RCA 10.7s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 9.6s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v05/workload**: pod-volume-mount-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 65.393, "metrics": {"run_id": "c98dcb54f2ff4c7c", "mttr": {"value": "1.1m", "seconds": 65.40600633621216, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-volume-mount-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 65406.00633621216, "llm_calls": 14, "llm_duration_ms": 62053.52282524109, "tool_calls": 15, "executed_tool_calls": 10, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 4, "successful_tool_calls": 14, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 8759.235620498657, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 2975.3623008728027}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 15110.032081604004, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 40705.435037612915, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 9562.711000442505, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

